"Source and destination folders cannot contain one another." = "源文件夹与备份位置不能相互包含。";
"Source files are only read and copied. Files deleted from the source can still be restored from older backups." = "源文件只会被读取和复制。从源位置删除的文件仍可从较早的备份中恢复。";
"Source folders cannot overlap or contain one another." = "源文件夹不能重复，也不能相互包含。";
