"Sunday" = "星期日";
"System Language" = "使用系统语言";
"System Language follows your Mac’s primary language and uses English for unsupported languages. Interface text changes immediately; reopen the app to update macOS menus and dialogs." = "系统语言会跟随 Mac 的首选语言，不支持的语言使用英语。应用界面文字会立即切换；重新打开应用后，macOS 菜单和对话框也会更新。";
"The app closed during a backup. The schedule is paused; resume manually when ready." = "应用退出导致备份中断。定时备份已暂停，可准备好后手动继续。";
"The first run saves all files. Later runs add new or changed contents; unchanged data is shared between versions. This also works on exFAT." = "首次运行保存全部文件，之后仅新增或更新已变化的内容。未变化的数据由多个版本共享，exFAT 上也采用相同方式。";
"The next run checks and reuses these copied files. Clean them up only if you no longer need them or are changing folders." = "下次运行会校验并复用这些文件。仅在不再需要这些副本或更换文件夹时清理。";
